                    :P736_LABEL := 'Semanal';
                    :P736_SEMANAINICIAL := null;
                    :P736_SEMANAFINAL := null;
                    :P736_CICLOROMANCE := null;
                    ```
                itemsToSubmit: P736_PERIODO
                itemsToReturn: [
                    P736_LABEL
                    P736_SEMANAINICIAL
                    P736_SEMANAFINAL
                    P736_CICLOROMANCE
